{"3842970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wraith Rage: A Shadow's Choice", "steam_appid": 3842970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842970/extras/4c300a816f0c5d84f2d395d0ebdbab34.poster.avif?t=1785251592\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842970/extras/4c300a816f0c5d84f2d395d0ebdbab34.webm?t=1785251592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842970/extras/4c300a816f0c5d84f2d395d0ebdbab34.mp4?t=1785251592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An isolated valley has been twisted into a living hell, its flesh and stone corrupted by a fanatical cult. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are mysteriously drawn into this decaying world. To survive, you must navigate its grotesque, gore-slicked paths and uncover the truth behind the cult's ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842970/extras/5315bf6b640c0a73ec44243629e73ccd.avif?t=1785251592\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This land is teeming with the cult's twisted congregation and nightmarish abominations born from a perverted prophecy. Each corner may hide a new terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842970/extras/72be742332a04795fca019bcc8bfec38.avif?t=1785251592\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >